        "Name": "Conventional Collet Or Split Ring Catcher",
        "ID": "Conventional",
        "Description": "A core catcher that is designed for consolidated rock and works by allowing the core to pass through it while coring and it mechanically activates when the bottom hole assembly is lifted from the formation. The core is captured by grips, and the split ring is closed. \u00a0",
